# Cloudflare Pages headers (copied into out/ by the Next build).
#
# 第8便 A — the silence regression's root: HTML was served with NO
# Cache-Control, so browsers heuristically cached stale pages whose hashed
# /_next chunks no longer exist after a redeploy → hydration never ran →
# every button dead, honestly-looking page. HTML must revalidate every time;
# hashed assets are immutable by content.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# more-specific rules INHERIT the catch-all; detach it first (Pages "!" syntax)
/_next/static/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
